{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112524","id":2990274197,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yO_aV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112524","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112524.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112524.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112524","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112524/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112524/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112524/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3812c74eab1f78fe5fe87fa234d8bc9c5ce0708b","number":112524,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Deterministic option to IterateIK3D","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Prerequisite https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111815\r\n\r\nIf deterministic option is `true`, the previous frame's result is discarded. At this point, the new result is calculated from the bone pose excluding the IterateIK3D as the initial state. This means the result will be always equal as long as the target position and the previous bone pose are the same. However, if `angular_delta_limit` and `max_iterations` are set too small, the end bone of the chain will never reach the target.\r\n\r\nSetting deterministic option is `true` and `angular_delta_limit` to 180 degrees will produce the same results as the old SkeletonIK in FABRIK.\r\n\r\nDeterministic FABRIK3D:\r\n<img width=\"1281\" height=\"501\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83587a39-21da-4131-ab6d-efb734167257\" />\r\n\r\nOld SkeletonIK3D:\r\n<img width=\"1340\" height=\"639\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d738c4af-4792-4228-a82f-a491bb5ba536\" />\r\n\r\n(As I mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110120#issuecomment-3500219143, the handling of Tips differs）\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/mile